ms that are ready for development, and the Definition of Ready is the criteria by which we can say that refinement has been successful – if a Definition of Ready is at all unclear, you need to revisit the refinement process! Technology Partner of Roman Bilinski Join the Fan Zone → Join our Team Career → Get in touch Contact us → Digital product creators & consultants Services Software Development Outsourcing Full Cycle Product Development Code audit & UX audit Product Prototyping MVP Development services Product-Market Fit Product Scaling Product Design and Development Development Teams AI Services Digital Transformation DevOps Consulting Our service standards UX/UI Design Services Claude Code Experts About us New Normal Contact Career Blog Boldare Boards Privacy Policy Cookie Settings Cookie Policy Whistleblowing Policy Newsroom For shareholders Gliwice Zwycięstwa 52 44-100 Gliwice Poland Warsaw Krucza 50 00-025 Warsaw Poland Wroclaw Wyspa Słodowa 7 50-266 Wroclaw Poland Cracow Kurniki 9 31-156 Cracow Poland Technology Partner of Roman Bilinski © 2026 Boldare. All rights reserved. Boldare S.A. z siedzibą w Gliwicach, przy ul. Zwycięstwa 52, zarejestrowana w Sądzie Rejonowym w Gliwicach, X Wydział Gospodarczy Krajowego Rejestru Sądowego pod nr KRS 0000914518, NIP 6312698829, REGON 389585559. Wysokość kapitału zakładowego i wpłaconego 100 000,00 zł."}, {"source_url": "https://www.boldare.com/blog/introducing-maxio-financial-operations-platform/", "source_type": "search_result", "field": "description", "text": "... United States, MAXIO. MAXIO is a financial operation platform designed to assist B2B SaaS companies by streamlining their financial operations. It automates ..."}, {"source_url": "https://www.boldare.com/blog/introducing-maxio-financial-operations-platform/", "source_type": "website_crawl", "field": "page_text", "text": "Boldare & MAXIO: Streamlining B2B SaaS Financial Operations | Boldare Iza Faber at Boldare - Product Design and Development Company Home B