t services, be light years ahead of our competition so we needed to do things differently Inspired by those who challenged the status quo Unlike others, we've invested as much in a future-proof dev environment as we have in building our business & services With a combined focus on both we are able to win big, and drive six-figure results for our clients. The environment is where everything starts 1 Processes and structure Product life cycle stages are miles apart! You need a completely different attitude, skill set and process for prototyping than you do for scaling. That’s why we’ve built four completely separate environments, one for each product stage, tied together by one set of common values and principles. 2 Decision-making COVID-19 pandemic, stock market crash, a new rival… our clients’ ecosystems change every day 3 ​​Education & Development We believe in organic, bottom-up personal growth and knowledge development 4 Trust The cornerstone of our environment Our business & services are how we move everything forward 1 Business and services The services shape Boldare, not the other way round! The entire company is aligned with the client’s and product’s business goals including our structure, culture and processes. 2 People To achieve the highest quality services we have gathered some awesome talents under our roof The numbers speak for us 7 Product strategists with over 20 various product-related certificates 6 Interdisciplinary experts in the role of distributed CTO 20+ Technologies in-house 1 Facilitator in every team 1 Service standard for all clients 300+ Released products 50% Of leaders are women 1 Human-first, AI-augmented engineering approach 62 Frameworks and tools in use, depending on the needs of the product 10+ Different workshop types dedicated to product and business development 1 Scrum master in every product development team 10+ Self-organized chapters - communities focused on problem solving Featured in Boldare Launches CTO as a Service with Unique Differentiators that Accelerate Growth and Enrich User Experience Holakracja. Nadchodzi świat pracy bez menedżerów “Die beste Karriereentscheidung? Ein Business-Hippie zu sein” – Anna Zarudzka von Boldare beantwortet den GQ-Business-Fragebogen Preparing For The Future Of Work: Anna Zarudzka of Boldare On The Top Five Trends To Watch In The Future Of Work Jaroslaw Kroczek von Boldare: \"Gute Bezahlung reicht heute nicht mehr aus\" Silicon Polska – der Tech-Hotspot in der europäischen Nachbarschaft We bet on steady growth... 30% growth in revenue, year on year 2020 2021 2022 2023 ...and do our best to share profits in a sustainable manner 20% divided between all employees 15% for development of employee knowledge and skills 10% CSR activities that support education and equality activities 20% for shareholders About Anna Zarudzka and Piotr Majchrzak are co-CEO’s of Boldare, an Agile and Lean Startup-powered product design and development company. Anna Zarudzka is an acknowledged speaker and an ambassador of New Work, Self-Management and so called \"Next Generation\" Organizations, driven by purpose not shareholders and empowering employees to make decisions and impact company direction. Piotr Majchrzak is an entrepreneur with a software development background, with numerous companies in his business portfolio While Piotr, a thoughtful rebel, looks after vision, constantly pushing towards new cutting-edge technologies and management practices, Anna is a spirited perfectionist, looking after processes and high service standards. Together they question the status quo in their industry and surround themselves with equally disruptive people. Anna Zarudzka in media Linkedin Preparing For The Future Of Work: Anna Zarudzka of Boldare On The Top Five Trends To Watch In The Future Of Work Future Candy - das neue Normal – Mit Anna Zarudzka (Podcast in English) Silicon Polska - the tech hotspot in the European neighborhood (article in German) “The best career decision? Being a business hippie” – Boldare's Anna Zarudzka answers the GQ business questionnaire (article in German) Piotr Majchrzak in media Linkedin Boldare Shakes The Workplace Up. For Good Holacracy in companies: structure, functioning - and salary negotiations Meet our founders Piotr Majchrzak and Anna Zarudzka Boldare's co-CEOs are a textbook example of a power couple... read more Our structure, where change is the only constant Meet the leaders who are responsible for the strategy of particular circles. They set new directions and push the organization forward. With holacracy as an operating system, they are able to adjust to new conditions, quickly and anytime. Technology Partner of Roman Bilinski Join the Fan Zone → Join our Team Career → Get in touch Contact us → Digital product creators & consultants Services Software Development Outsourcing Full Cycle Product Development Code audit & UX audit Product Prototyping MVP Development services Product-Market Fit Product Scaling Product Design and Development Development Teams AI Services Digital Transformation DevOps Consulting Our service standards UX/UI Design Services Claude Code Experts About us New Normal Contact Career Blog Boldare Boards Privacy Policy Cookie Settings Cookie Policy Whistleblowing Policy Newsroom For shareholders Gliwice Zwycięstwa 52 44-100 Gliwice Poland Warsaw Krucza 50 00-025 Warsaw Poland Wroclaw Wyspa Słodowa 7 50-266 Wroclaw Poland Cracow Kurniki 9 31-156 Cracow Poland Technology Partner of Roman Bilinski © 2026 Boldare. All rights reserved. Boldare S.A. z siedzibą w Gliwicach, przy ul. Zwycięstwa 52, zarejestrowana w Sądzie Rejonowym w Gliwicach, X Wydział Gospodarczy Krajowego Rejestru Sądowego pod nr KRS 0000914518, NIP 6312698829, REGON 389585559. Wysokość kapitału zakładowego i wpłaconego 100 000,00 zł.", "error": null, "receipt": {"trace_id": "0aa46b8da63e4b3b98ea7467e6807dcc", "status": "observed", "operation": "read", "action_class": "READ_PUBLIC", "acquisition_context": "e54b49995c16afc